mium signature leatherette or fabric upholstery, offering you the option of sleek sophistication or cozy elegance. Your chair, your way.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/own_your_sit_Liquid_Edition_white.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_y9w6bc":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #24a2e9; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>LUXURY. <br\/>ENDURANCE. <br\/>SUSTAINABILITY <br\/>ALL IN ONE<\/p>","sub_title":"NEXGEN ECO LEATHERETTE","description":"<p>Experience the perfect fusion of luxury and durability with our sustainable leatherette. Delivering the premium feel of NAPA leather, it boasts 15 times the strength of standard PU, ensuring long-lasting performance while helping protect the planet.<\/p>","file_position":"right","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SOFT_YET_FIRM_BEST_OF_BOTH_WORLDS_Liquid_Edition_white.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_e8zHd8":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #24a2e9; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>SOFT YET SUPPORTIVE – <\/p><p>THE PERFECT BALANCE<\/p>","sub_title":"ULTRA-SOFT MEMORY FOAM","description":"<p>Why settle for stiff, uncomfortable foam when our upgraded ultra-soft memory foam offers superior softness and lasting resilience? It cradles you in cloud-like comfort while providing the perfect support, designed to keep you comfortable, focused, and supported for years to come.<\/p>","file_position":"left","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_i